    "updated_at": "2018-04-15T16:57:13Z",
    "body": "I was under the impression that the specification process was supposed to be an open and transparent process where feedback and discussion around the intricacies of implementations was welcomed. Since the opinion here is already made, and I don't work at Google, it seems there's nothing more I can bring to this discussion.",
