    "created_at": "2018-04-15T17:01:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-15T17:01:46Z",
    "body": "I see nothing in my comment that would lead to the kind of ad hominem message you have sent, @guybedford. Indeed, I tried to provide you with details on the intricacies of implementation and why and how we made the decision we did during the open and transparent process that took place during #433. I also have no idea why you are bringing Google into this.\r\n\r\nPerhaps if you wish to continue this discussion, it's best placed [on whatwg/meta](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/issues), so that we can continue to focus this thread on technical aspects (like the ones I explained in my post) and not ad hominem meta-critiques.",
