    "body": "If `dep.js` contains `import './index'`, it imports `https://cdn.com/react@1.2.3/index`.\r\n\r\nSpecifier resolution is via the response URL. Module map keys are via the request URL. They are unrelated, as noted already in the specification:\r\n\r\n> It is intentional that the module map is keyed by the request URL, whereas the base URL for the module script is set to the response URL. The former is used to deduplicate fetches, while the latter is used for URL resolution.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/381422419/reactions",
